Scope of this license

The MIT grant above covers this repository's own code and documentation
(the workspace packages, tests, tooling and docs sources).

The following files are licensed separately and are NOT covered by this
license — nothing in the MIT grant extends to them:

1. Bundled fonts — packages/tokens/fonts/ (DaytonaSans-*.woff2,
   DaytonaPragma-*.woff2, daytona.css). These are separately licensed assets
   distributed under usage + renaming license agreements held by the
   maintainer with Monotype Imaging Inc. and ParaType. The terms governing
   these files are stated in packages/tokens/fonts/LICENSE-FONTS.md.

2. Vendored transitions.dev recipes — transitions/t-*.css and
   transitions/_root.css. These files are vendored, unmodified, from the
   transitions.dev free recipes pack and remain subject to the upstream
   usage terms (https://transitions.dev/terms.html): every recipe — free or
   Pro — may be used in unlimited personal and commercial projects, modified
   freely and shipped as part of your product; redistributing the collection
   itself, or a substantial part of it, as a library/template pack is not
   permitted. These files are repository-local source material and are not
   part of any published npm package.

3. Protect Auto reference assets — packages/docs/public/brand/. These bounded
   local Storybook copies came from the public Protect Auto site under the
   user's authorization for this adaptation. They are not covered by the MIT
   grant above and are not part of any published npm package. Exact source
   URLs, dimensions and SHA-256 hashes are recorded in
   docs/SOURCE-PROVENANCE.md.
